{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The HDMI cable fits my pattern of connecting and organizing existing equipment, including my computer and Raspberry Pi.",
    "Its longer length could help with equipment placement, much like the extension cable and cable-management supplies in my history."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Streaming sticks do not address the networking and workspace upkeep needs reflected in my recent choices; owning a Raspberry Pi does not mean I need another entertainment device.",
    "Echo devices and the smart plug assume an interest in voice control and home automation that my activity does not show.",
    "The tablets and portable speaker add devices without a clear current purpose for me. My Kindle and headphone purchases do not establish a need for another screen or a speaker."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Having bought a Kindle and Amazon Basics accessories seems to have been treated as a broad interest in Amazon devices.",
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been stretched into an interest in streaming, voice assistants, and portable entertainment."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest interactions emphasize practical tasks: wired networking, storing headphones, carrying a laptop, and cleaning equipment.",
    "The useful connection across many of my choices is supporting equipment I already use, with attention to compatibility and a specific job each accessory can do."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The cable recommendation recognized my setup needs, but most of the list interpreted practical electronics purchases as a desire for more entertainment and Alexa devices."
}"}
